ADD MAP FLEMILEM VERSION 1
    DEVICE IS 3270 SIZE IS 24 BY 80
    RECORDS ARE FLEWORK EMPLOYEE MILEAGE-CLAIM BENEFIT-PERIOD
    .
    LITERAL 'FLEMILE'                      ROW 1  COLUMN 2  INTENSITY BRIGHT.
    LITERAL 'BUSINESS MILEAGE CLAIM'       ROW 1  COLUMN 29 INTENSITY BRIGHT.
    LITERAL 'EMPLOYEE ID'                  ROW 4  COLUMN 2.
    FIELD WK-EMPID                         ROW 4  COLUMN 16 LENGTH 8 UNPROTECTED.
    FIELD EM-FORN                          ROW 4  COLUMN 28 LENGTH 15 PROTECTED.
    FIELD EM-SURN                          ROW 4  COLUMN 44 LENGTH 20 PROTECTED.
    LITERAL 'DATE OF JOURNEY'              ROW 7  COLUMN 2.
    FIELD MC-DATE                          ROW 7  COLUMN 20 LENGTH 8 UNPROTECTED
        EDIT PICTURE IS 9(8) REQUIRED.
    LITERAL 'MILES'                        ROW 8  COLUMN 2.
    FIELD MC-MILES                         ROW 8  COLUMN 20 LENGTH 5 UNPROTECTED
        EDIT PICTURE IS 9(5) REQUIRED.
    LITERAL 'PURPOSE'                      ROW 9  COLUMN 2.
    FIELD MC-PURP                          ROW 9  COLUMN 20 LENGTH 10 UNPROTECTED.
    LITERAL 'RATE PER MILE'                ROW 11 COLUMN 2.
    FIELD BP-MRATE                         ROW 11 COLUMN 20 LENGTH 5 PROTECTED
        EDIT PICTURE IS 9.999.
    LITERAL 'AMOUNT'                       ROW 12 COLUMN 2.
    FIELD WK-AMOUNT                        ROW 12 COLUMN 20 LENGTH 12 PROTECTED
        EDIT PICTURE IS ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
    FIELD WK-MSG                           ROW 22 COLUMN 2  LENGTH 60 PROTECTED.
    LITERAL 'ENTER=SUBMIT  PF3=MENU'       ROW 24 COLUMN 2.
